sequenceDiagram
  participant C as CLI/API/Scheduler
  participant U as Application use case
  participant D as SQL state/outbox
  participant W as Worker
  participant P as Domain/provider port
  participant O as Object storage

  C->>U: start high-level workflow
  U->>D: TX command + run + job + outbox
  U-->>C: accepted job/run IDs
  W->>D: claim fenced lease
  W->>D: create attempt + heartbeat
  W->>P: execute typed task(deadline, abort)
  P->>O: stage output
  P-->>W: validated artifact evidence
  W->>D: TX promote asset + complete step + next job/outbox
  alt approval required
    D-->>C: waiting_for_approval event/status
    C->>U: approve bound challenge
    U->>D: TX approval + runnable job + audit
  end
